      "content": "7. 3D FIGURES"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "oxlicft",
      "content": "Cube:<br></br>Volume = a³, TSA = 6a²<br></br><br></br>Cuboid:<br></br>Volume = l × b × h<br></br><br></br>Cylinder:<br></br>Volume = πr²h"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "rhfjqob",
      "content": "Example:<br></br>Cube side = 5 cm<br></br>Volume = 125 cm³"
    },
